  "seoTitle": "Rear Extension Planning Permission in Coventry",
  "summary": "Check planning routes for a Coventry rear extension and use the council’s design guidance to assess boundaries, windows and ground levels.",
  "primaryKeyword": "rear extension planning permission coventry",
